tps://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-09-09T14:04:20Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T16:01:54Z","closed_at":"2026-01-06T16:01:54Z","assignee":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.5.rc1 [08e9e6b29]\n- Not Reproducible in v4.5.beta6 [d5ad0556a]\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot v4.5.rc1 - Forward+\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf a node inheriting SkeletonModifer3D is present in the main scene when the application starts, the `_process_modification_with_delta` method is initially called with a `delta` value of `0.0`, which caused some downstream NaN issues. This seems like a bug to me because it seems unexpected that the frame delta should ever be `0.0`, and thus requires always checking for this case. The latest docs do not warn about this issue either.\n\n(Totally separate issue, but it was even harder to diagnose because the debugger is displaying NaN values as `0.0`).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI have included a MRP, but it is trivial to reproduce with out it.\n\n1. Create a new scene with a Skeleton3D as root. No bones or any other data is required.\n2. Create the following class:\n```\nclass_name ZeroDelta extends SkeletonModifier3D\n\nfunc _process_modification_with_delta(delta):\n    if delta == 0.0:\n        breakpoint\n```\n3. Add an instance of ZeroDelta as a child of the Skeleton3D.\n4. Run the scene.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[skeleton-modifier-3d-zero-delta.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22235910/skeleton-modifier-3d-zero-delta.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110350/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110350/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}